# Loaded by `npm run build` (Vite's production mode), so `make deploy` always
# ships a bundle pointing at the live backend — from a fresh clone too.
# Public URL of a public service, not a secret; it is committed on purpose.
# It must stay in APP_ALLOW_ORIGINS' counterpart: see backend/Makefile `deploy`.
